<view wx:if="{{pendingSave}}" class="card">
  <view>有一笔提交待核验。请勿重新录入；重启后仍需先核验原提交。</view>
  <button bindtap="verifySave">核验保存结果</button>
  <button wx:if="{{retryable}}" bindtap="retrySave">已确认未写入，安全重试原提交</button>
</view>
<view class="container"><view class="title">{{recordId ? '更正期初持仓' : '录入已有持仓'}}</view><view class="subtitle">以同一个期初日确认数量与总成本，不需要补齐过去每笔交易。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="note">期初持仓不是买入交易，不计入买卖笔数。账本仍会标注历史不完整、现金未知。</view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">统一期初日期</view><picker disabled="{{lockedDate}}" mode="date" value="{{date}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="onDate"><view class="picker">{{date}}　{{lockedDate ? '（已统一）' : '⌄'}}</view></picker><view class="muted">所有期初持仓采用同一天，且不能晚于已有交易。</view></view>
    <view class="field"><label class="label">股票代码</label><input value="{{symbol}}" data-field="symbol" bindinput="onField" placeholder="例如 QQQ、AAPL"/></view>
    <view class="field"><view class="label">资产类型</view><view class="actions"><button class="{{assetType === 'ETF' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-type="ETF" bindtap="onType">ETF</button><button class="{{assetType === 'STOCK' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-type="STOCK" bindtap="onType">股票</button></view></view>
    <view class="field"><label class="label">期初数量（股）</label><input type="digit" value="{{quantity}}" data-field="quantity" bindinput="onField"/></view>
    <view class="field"><label class="label">确认总成本（USD）</label><input type="digit" value="{{totalCost}}" data-field="totalCost" bindinput="onField"/><view class="muted">填写这批持仓实际确认的总成本，不使用当前价格代替。</view></view>
    <view class="field"><label class="label">成本依据（选填）</label><textarea value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="onField" placeholder="例如券商持仓成本截图日期"/></view><button class="secondary" disabled="{{saving || pendingSave}}" bindtap="preview">预览期初结果</button>
  </view><view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="card"><view class="symbol">保存前核对</view><view class="row"><text>期初数量</text><text>{{quantity}} 股</text></view><view class="row"><text>确认总成本</text><text>${{preview.amount}}</text></view><view class="divider"/><view>回放全部后续记录后</view><view>持仓数量 {{preview.before.quantity}} → {{preview.after.quantity}}</view><view>剩余成本 ${{preview.before.cost}} → ${{preview.after.cost}}</view><view>已实现盈亏 ${{preview.before.realized}} → ${{preview.after.realized}}</view><view wx:if="{{preview.affectedPositions.length > 1}}" class="card"><view class="label">更正影响的全部标的</view><view wx:for="{{preview.affectedPositions}}" wx:key="symbol"><view>{{item.symbol}}：{{item.before.quantity}} → {{item.after.quantity}} 股</view><view>剩余成本 ${{item.before.cost}} → ${{item.after.cost}}；已实现盈亏 ${{item.before.realized}} → ${{item.after.realized}}</view></view></view>
    <button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || pendingSave}}" bindtap="submit">确认保存</button></view>
</view>
